  "problem": "By changing the order of integration, find the missing limits in the following repeated integral.\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-{z}^{2}-1}^{-z}{\\int }_{0}^{2y+z}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z={\\int }_{-2}^{p}{\\int }_{q}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2y+z}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{r}{\\int }_{0}^{2y+z}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\n$$",
